OL,3,GNEWSAKey signed by Superman found
OL,4,A'hiding in plain sight'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA piece of Superman memorabilia signed
OL,7,Fby the late actor Christopher Reeve is
OL,8,Fbeing auctioned by a charity after
OL,9,Fbeing found "hiding in plain sight" at
OL,10,Fits office for more than 40 years.
OL,12,FThe wooden commemorative key had been
OL,13,Fhanging on the wall of Age UK's Milton
OL,14,FKeynes building, which had served as a
OL,15,Fproduction base for Superman IV: The
OL,16,FQuest for Peace.
OL,18,FScenes for the 1987 movie saw Reeve
OL,19,Fdangled above Milton Keynes Central
OL,20,FStation in his superhero costume.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
