OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity hoped the online sale would
OL,7,Fraise enough money to fund "urgent
OL,8,Frepairs and improvements" to its
OL,9,Fbuilding, ensuring it remained a
OL,10,F"welcoming and accessible place".
